<title>JAPAN: Comson says completes payment of promissory notes.</title>
<headline>Comson says completes payment of promissory notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Machinery maker Comson Corp said on Thursday it had completed payment of promissory notes due on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Comson president Toshimi Matsuda said on Wednesday that the company was having trouble raising 100 million yen to cover promissory notes due on Thursday.</p>
<p>At that time he said Comson had a total of 300 million yen worth of promissory notes due on Thursday.</p>
</text>
